/P 17 0 R
/E (This study investigates human behavioural patterns within different tourist contexts, observing how visitors interact with space, infrastructure, information systems, and other people. To examine how context influences behaviour, four prominent tourist sites in Gujarat were selected: Kankaria Lake, Indroda Nature Park, Dandi Kutir, and Adalaj Stepwell. Each of these locations represents a distinct tourist context such as recreational space, nature park, museum environment, and historical heritage site.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [138]
>>
