/P 17 0 R
/E (Storytelling enhances information intake by presenting facts within a narrative that is easier for people to follow, remember, and emotionally connect with. Instead of processing isolated pieces of information, visitors experience the content as a sequence of events, characters, or journeys, which naturally sustains attention and improves retention.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [183]
>>
endobj
